      <description><![CDATA[<p>Summer the dog has a smoother run and says hello when a scan finishes. Pick DiskHare or Summer in Settings › General. If some locations can&#x27;t be read, Overview lists them and opens Full Disk Access for you. Cancelling a scan responds right away, and the app version is shown under the window and in Settings.</p>]]></description>
